Package: ark
Version: @DEB_ARK_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.kde.org/ark/
Depends: qt6-base, kf6-config, kf6-crash, kf6-dbusaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-kio, kf6-service, kf6-parts, kf6-widgetsaddons, kf6-windowsystem, kf6-iconthemes, libarchive13
Description: Ark archive manager (Qt6/KF6)
 KDE archive manager for creating, browsing, and extracting archives. This
 first Xios package uses the libarchive backend and avoids KF6Pty and
 KFileMetaData while the terminal/PTY stack is still being stabilized.
